{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_11","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"rg -n 'Node|Dart|command|shadow|cljd' collab/1791371000000-vm-engineer-ucf-d15a-driver-split.findings.md | head -25; ls /private/tmp | rg 'd15a' | head -40; cat shadow-cljs.edn | head -90; sed -n '1,115p' src/dev/cljd_agg.clj\"","aggregated_output":"9:The scoped implementation is complete and the focused driver suite passes on JVM, Node and Dart. The full JVM fast lane also passes. The earlier inbox blocker is resolved by the architect's amended assembly contract in `1791374000000-architect-d15a-inbox-ruling-astra.gpt-6-astra.findings.md`, read in full from the main tree.\n87:- Node focused: shadow `compile test` with the anchored driver namespace regex — **104 tests, 1584 assertions, 0 failures, 0 errors**; **159 files, 4 compiled, 0 warnings**. Log: `/private/tmp/d15a-node-focused-final.log`. `NODE_PATH` supplied dependencies from the main tree's existing `node_modules`; that tree was read, not edited.\n88:- Dart focused: `bb src/dev/cljd_agg.clj --only yin.vm.ucf.holder.driver-test` — **104 tests, 0 failing tests**, `All tests passed!`. Log: `/private/tmp/d15a-dart-focused-final.log`. The runner does not print assertion totals; none are claimed. Flutter cache access used approved escalation.\n89:- Full JVM fast lane: `bb test:clj` — **3654 tests, 238191 assertions, 0 failures, 0 errors**. Log: `/private/tmp/d15a-jvm-fast-final.log`. Node REPL build and pinned Python parser generation were included. This run included unrelated v2 test changes present in the shared worktree.\n94:Fast-lane qualifications: `^:slow` tests were excluded by the existing task. The JVM log also reports host-inapplicable codec skips and skips `a-dart-dialer-reads-a-jvm-server` because `build/ws-project-peer` is absent. That optional cross-host executable was not built. No full Node or full Dart project-wide fast lane was run; the full D15a driver namespace ran on both.\n96:Earlier green snapshots: driver **97/1456**, then **100/1561**; Node **100/1561** and Dart **100 tests**; an earlier full JVM snapshot **3647/237783**, all with zero failures/errors. These are not substituted for the final counts.\n136:- Full JVM fast lane: `NODE_PATH=/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/node_modules bb test:clj` — **3657 tests / 238212 assertions / 0 failures / 0 errors**, exit 0. Log: `/private/tmp/d15a-r1-fast.log`. Slow tests remain excluded; five host-inapplicable CBOR conformance cases were skipped, and the Dart-dialer/JVM-server row was skipped because `build/ws-project-peer` is absent.\n138:- Node and Dart focused lanes were not rerun in this narrow JVM-requested round; the preceding whole-task results above remain historical, not new evidence.\nd15a-architecture.txt\nd15a-cadence-red.log\nd15a-dart-focused-final.log\nd15a-dart-focused1.log\nd15a-driver-dart-baseline.log\nd15a-driver-dart-baseline2.log\nd15a-driver-iteration1.log\nd15a-driver-iteration10.log\nd15a-driver-iteration11.log\nd15a-driver-iteration2.log\nd15a-driver-iteration3.log\nd15a-driver-iteration4.log\nd15a-driver-iteration5.log\nd15a-driver-iteration6.log\nd15a-driver-iteration7.log\nd15a-driver-iteration8.log\nd15a-driver-iteration9.log\nd15a-driver-jvm-baseline.log\nd15a-driver-node-baseline.log\nd15a-driver-node-baseline2.log\nd15a-fork-isolation-red.log\nd15a-inbox-cut-red.log\nd15a-inbox-cut.clj\nd15a-jvm-fast-final.log\nd15a-jvm-fast.log\nd15a-jvm-focused-final.log\nd15a-kondo-final.log\nd15a-kondo1.log\nd15a-kondo2.log\nd15a-kondo3.log\nd15a-kondo4.log\nd15a-kondo5.log\nd15a-kondo6.log\nd15a-node-focused-final.log\nd15a-node-focused1.log\nd15a-partial-drain-red.log\nd15a-post-cycle-refusal-red.log\nd15a-r1-fast.log\nd15a-r1-focused.log\nd15a-r1-green.log\n;; shadow-cljs configuration\n;; Source paths come from deps.edn (:paths plus the :cljs alias's\n;; :extra-paths); shadow ignores any :source-paths set here when :deps\n;; is used.\n{:deps {:aliases [:cljs]}\n\n :dev-http {9000 \"public\"}\n\n :builds {:demo {:target :browser\n                 :devtools {:use-document-protocol true}\n                 :modules {:main {:init-fn datomworld.demo/init}}}\n\n          :local {:target :browser\n                  :devtools {:use-document-protocol true}\n                  :closure-defines {datomworld.demo/WEBSOCKET_PORT 8090}\n                  :modules {:main {:init-fn datomworld.demo/init}}}\n\n          :test {:target :node-test\n                 :output-to \"target/node-tests.js\"\n                 :autorun true}\n\n          :vm-bench {:target :node-script\n                     :main bench.yin-vm-bench/-main\n                     :output-to \"target/vm-bench.js\"}\n\n          :yin-repl {:target :node-script\n                        :main yin.repl.main/-main\n                        :output-to \"target/yin-repl.js\"}}}\n(ns cljd-agg\n  \"Dart test runner that aggregates the generated test files.\n\n   `flutter test` loads every generated *_test.dart separately (about 7.5 s\n   each). This runner compiles the test namespaces through the cljd tool,\n   groups the generated files into a few shard files that import them and call\n   each `main`, and runs `flutter test` on the shards only. Shards live under\n   build/, never under test/, so a plain `cljd test` never runs them twice.\n\n   Run with babashka:\n     bb src/dev/cljd_agg.clj [--slow-only | --slow-regex | --only NS,NS...]\n   --slow-only restricts the run to the namespaces that use dao.test-slow/guard.\n   A namespace in that set with no generated Dart file is fatal.\n   --only compiles and runs only the given test namespaces (bb test:changed);\n   one with no generated Dart file is fatal too.\n   --slow-regex prints, for bb.edn, an anchored alternation of those\n   namespaces with its dots already escaped for embedding in an EDN string\n   (shadow-cljs --config-merge); it is not a ready-to-use regex. It exits 1\n   when no namespace uses the guard, so a slow lane cannot be vacuous.\n   DATOM_SLOW_TESTS is inherited from the environment.\"\n  (:require\n    [babashka.fs :as fs]\n    [babashka.process :as p]\n    [clojure.string :as str]))\n\n\n(def test-root \"test\")\n(def out-root \"test/cljd-out\")\n(def shard-dir \"build/cljd-agg\")\n(def max-shards 8)\n\n\n(defn- ns-of\n  \"The namespace declared by the first ns form of `file`.\"\n  [file]\n  (second (re-find #\"\\(ns\\s+\\^?(?:\\{[^}]*\\}\\s+)?([^\\s\\)]+)\" (slurp file))))\n\n\n(defn- source-files\n  []\n  (->> (file-seq (fs/file test-root))\n       (filter #(re-find #\"_test\\.clj[cd]$\" (str %)))\n       (remove #(str/includes? (str %) \"cljd-out\"))\n       (map str)\n       sort))\n\n\n(defn- test-namespaces\n  \"Distinct: a namespace with both a .cljc and a .cljd source (for example\n   dao.stream.cbor-test) has one generated Dart file, which must run once.\"\n  []\n  (distinct (keep ns-of (source-files))))\n\n\n(defn- slow-namespaces\n  \"Namespaces whose source uses dao.test-slow/guard, derived from the tree.\"\n  []\n  (->> (source-files)\n       (filter #(re-find #\"slow/guard\" (slurp %)))\n       (keep ns-of)\n       distinct\n       sort))\n\n\n(defn- dart-file\n  \"Generated file path for namespace `ns-name`.\"\n  [ns-name]\n  (str out-root \"/\" (str/replace ns-name \".\" \"/\") \"_test.dart\"))\n\n\n(defn- run!*\n  [& args]\n  (let [{:keys [exit]} (apply p/shell {:continue true} args)]\n    exit))\n\n\n(defn compile-tests\n  \"Compile every test namespace through the cljd tool.\"\n  [namespaces]\n  (let [exit (apply run!* \"clojure\" \"-M:clojuredart:cljd\" \"compile\"\n                    namespaces)]\n    (when-not (zero? exit)\n      (println \"cljd compile failed, exit\" exit)\n      (System/exit exit))))\n\n\n(defn shard\n  \"Greedy balanced partition of `files` into `n` groups by file size.\n   Deterministic: ties are broken by path.\"\n  [files n]\n  (let [sized (sort-by (juxt (comp - fs/size) identity) files)\n        init  (vec (repeat n {:size 0 :files []}))]\n    (->> sized\n         (reduce (fn [shards f]\n                   (let [i (first (first (sort-by\n                                           (juxt (comp :size second) first)\n                                           (map-indexed vector shards))))]\n                     (-> shards\n                         (update-in [i :size] + (fs/size f))\n                         (update-in [i :files] conj f))))\n                 init)\n         (map (comp sort :files))\n         (remove empty?))))\n\n\n(defn- shard-source\n  \"Dart source of an aggregator importing `files` and calling each main.\"\n  [files]\n  (let [rel (fn [f]\n              (str (fs/relativize (fs/absolutize shard-dir)\n                                  (fs/absolutize f))))]\n    (str \"// Generated by src/dev/cljd_agg.clj; do not edit.\\n\"\n         (apply str\n                (map-indexed (fn [i f]\n                               (str \"import '\" (rel f) \"' as m\" i \";\\n\"))\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
